 445: /**
 446:  * Runs one body and refuses a pass that observed nothing.
 447:  *
 448:  * Still parameterized by SHAPE rather than by `<R, K>`, and that is not an oversight. It is not a
 449:  * door to the seam: it never produces a harness-backed value, so the only context it can be given
