  12:  * sentinels/faults, H4 oracles, H5 vendor sims), and `pendingCapability()` in `index.ts` is what
  13:  * stands where one has not landed â€” a seam that throws the capability's name, never a no-op.
  14:  *
  15:  * Requirement-SPECIFIC types stay in the suite: which system under test it drives, what its
  16:  * fixture world can do. The generics below are the joints those bolt onto.
  17:  */
  18: 
  19: export type { Tier } from './registry.ts';
  20: export { TIERS } from './registry.ts';
  21: export type { ConfigRegistry } from './config.ts';
  22: 
  23: import type { ConfigRegistry } from './config.ts';
  24: import type { Tier } from './registry.ts';
