  28: // The suite names TWO STRINGS and no types at all: which requirement it is, and which member of
  29: // `harness.sut` it drives. It deliberately cannot name - or re-label - the harness TYPE: that shape
  30: // comes from the one shared contract the harness factory is statically checked to produce, so a
  31: // suite can never declare a seam nothing supplies.
