  33: // It can no longer name its own system-under-test or world type either. It used to
  34: // (`bindSuite<NotificationsSut, World>`), and that was two independent statements about one thing:
  35: // this file said what the seam is, `_fixture.ts` built what the seam is, and nothing compared them
  36: // - so any pair of type arguments type-checked green and a body could read members no adapter
  37: // supplies. Both shapes are now DERIVED from the adapter registered under 'req-016' in
