  41: /* ------------------------------------------------------------------ SUT (REQ-016) */
  42: 
  43: /*
  44:  * TYPE ALIASES, NOT INTERFACES, FROM HERE DOWN â€” the same rule `contracts.ts` states for the shared
  45:  * seams, arriving at this file only now, and for a reason that did not exist before.
  46:  *
  47:  * Nothing reachable from the objects `open()` hands a test body may be an interface, because an
  48:  * interface can be reopened with `declare module` and a member merged into it read green off a
  49:  * value that never supplies it. An OPTIONAL member is what makes that slip past everything: the
  50:  * producer still satisfies its annotation, so nothing goes red anywhere, and the body reads
  51:  * `undefined` at run time believing it read data.
  52:  *
  53:  * These types sat OUTSIDE that boundary while `open().sut` and `open().w` were the suite's own type
  54:  * arguments â€” pinning your own types hides a merged member rather than rejecting it, which is
  55:  * exactly why "REQ-016 is not affected" was never an answer. AI4DEV-31 derives both from the
  56:  * adapter instead, so `open().sut` now resolves to `NotificationsSut` and everything its methods
  57:  * return is on the seam path. Being on that path is what puts them under the rule.
  58:  *
  59:  * The severity did drop on the way in: with one derived type, a merged-in REQUIRED member breaks
  60:  * the adapter itself (TS2741). What the alias conversion kills is the OPTIONAL member that reads
  61:  * `undefined` and breaks nothing â€” precisely the case that slipped past two adversarial gates in
  62:  * AI4DEV-24 and is the reason this rule exists at all.
  63:  *
  64:  * `World` is deliberately NOT converted, and `harness/type-invention.selftest.ts` records why so a
  65:  * later author does not "restore uniformity" without knowing: after the derivation `open().w` is
  66:  * the adapter's concrete fixture-world CLASS, and a class does not acquire members merely because
  67:  * an interface it implements was augmented, so the read is rejected either way. Converting it would
  68:  * buy nothing. That is measured, not assumed â€” re-measure before changing it.
  69:  */
  70: 
